Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: Polog Barangay Captain Glenn Royang, N-Council,

asr-000022
00:02:54.320 --> 00:03:02.060
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: Pulpogan Barangay Captain Avelino Bihag, Tayod Barangay Fek Kuyos, N-Council,

asr-000023
