asr-000030
00:03:29.200 --> 00:03:30.380
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Karong Adlawa, ha?

asr-000031
00:03:30.380 --> 00:03:37.020
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Of course, the municipal and barangay officials from the Municipality of Consolacion,

asr-000032
