asr-000316
00:38:29.040 --> 00:38:31.720
Rep. Ma. Cristina Talavera Lopez: of these cases by the end of this year.

asr-000317
00:38:32.160 --> 00:38:32.580
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ayun.

asr-000318
00:38:32.920 --> 00:38:36.800
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, yun lang po ang gusto natin ay makuha yung update.

asr-000319
00:38:37.700 --> 00:38:40.800
