asr-000326
00:38:52.160 --> 00:38:53.080
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 289 cases.

asr-000327
00:38:53.080 --> 00:38:57.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At sa 289 cases na yan, 140 po.

