asr-000329
00:38:59.040 --> 00:39:07.520
Rep. Ma. Cristina Talavera Lopez: 120 cases was transmitted and had undergone preliminary evaluation by the EGK task force.

asr-000330
00:39:07.600 --> 00:39:10.660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ah, 120 cases.

asr-000331
00:39:10.920 --> 00:39:16.900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And then, yung for resolution na po, pending resolution ay ilan po?

asr-000332
00:39:17.780 --> 00:39:18.860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ito na po yun.

asr-000333
00:39:19.680 --> 00:39:20.520
Rep. Ma. Cristina Talavera Lopez: Ito na po yun.

asr-000334
00:39:20.900 --> 00:39:21.200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

asr-000335
00:39:22.020 --> 00:39:23.400
Rep. Ma. Cristina Talavera Lopez: Yung 120 cases.

asr-000336
00:39:24.160 --> 00:39:25.420
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 120 po?

asr-000337
00:39:25.480 --> 00:39:25.920
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 120?

