asr-000343
00:39:53.200 --> 00:39:57.260
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, which figure?

asr-000344
00:39:57.260 --> 00:40:01.660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Which figure should we consider as official?

asr-000345
00:40:03.660 --> 00:40:05.260
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 120 or 140?

asr-000346
00:40:05.960 --> 00:40:08.180
Rep. Ma. Cristina Talavera Lopez: As of today po, 140 cases.

asr-000347
00:40:08.540 --> 00:40:09.700
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 140 po.

asr-000348
00:40:10.080 --> 00:40:11.680
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 40, hindi 20.

asr-000349
00:40:14.920 --> 00:40:16.640
Rep. Ma. Cristina Talavera Lopez: 140 cases po.

asr-000350
00:40:16.640 --> 00:40:16.920
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ayun.

asr-000351
00:40:17.120 --> 00:40:17.340
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

asr-000352
00:40:17.520 --> 00:40:19.700
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, it is indeed 140 cases.

asr-000353
00:40:20.440 --> 00:40:24.420
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, yun lang po, Madam Speaker.

asr-000354
00:40:24.420 --> 00:40:26.420
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ang gusto lang po nating marinig ay...

asr-000355
00:40:27.260 --> 00:40:40.700
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: na at least by the end of the year, of the over 600 cases mentioned, merong for disposition

asr-000356
00:40:40.700 --> 00:40:42.960
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: na 140 by the end of the year.

asr-000357
00:40:43.760 --> 00:40:44.040
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

asr-000358
00:40:45.020 --> 00:40:46.720
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: We will expect that update.

asr-000359
00:40:47.400 --> 00:40:50.100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pero, ano po yung mangyayari dun sa natitira?

asr-000360
00:40:50.100 --> 00:40:54.740
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yung mga 2024 cases at saka yung iba pang 2025?

asr-000361
00:40:56.140 --> 00:40:57.020
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ano po?

asr-000362
00:40:57.020 --> 00:40:58.020
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ano po ang mangyayari sa mga iyon?

asr-000363
00:40:58.220 --> 00:41:00.500
Rep. Ma. Cristina Talavera Lopez: Dire-direcho pa rin po yung investigation.

asr-000364
00:41:00.680 --> 00:41:02.600
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Dire-direcho pa rin po yung investigation.

asr-000365
00:41:02.880 --> 00:41:14.440
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, makakaasa po tayo na bukod dito sa 140 na target na ma-resolve at magbibigay ng

asr-000366
00:41:14.440 --> 00:41:22.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ulat ang CHR kaugnay nito ay tuloy-tuloy pa rin po yung investigation dun sa remaining

asr-000367
00:41:22.880 --> 00:41:24.020
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: cases na nabanggit nyo.

asr-000368
00:41:24.800 --> 00:41:25.320
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tama po ba?

asr-000369
00:41:26.020 --> 00:41:26.860
Rep. Ma. Cristina Talavera Lopez: Tama po kayo.

asr-000370
00:41:27.020 --> 00:41:28.680
Rep. Ma. Cristina Talavera Lopez: Madam Speaker.

asr-000371
00:41:29.180 --> 00:41:29.360
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

asr-000372
00:41:30.120 --> 00:41:39.860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, again, we thank the sponsor for putting on record this commitment of the CHR.

asr-000373
00:41:39.860 --> 00:41:45.480
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Now, we will expect, of course, through the Committee on Appropriations, we will expect

asr-000374
00:41:45.480 --> 00:41:49.260
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: the report on the disposition of the 140 cases.

asr-000375
00:41:49.720 --> 00:41:55.860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Katulad po ng sinabi natin, well, CHR po ang isa sa mga natatanging

asr-000376
00:41:57.020 --> 00:42:00.800
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: institusyon sa ating lipunan na nagtutuloy

asr-000377
00:42:00.800 --> 00:42:12.060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: pa rin ng imbestigasyon sa extrajudicial killings during the Duterte, under the Duterte

asr-000378
00:42:12.060 --> 00:42:15.320
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Administration in the name of the War on Drugs.

asr-000379
00:42:16.260 --> 00:42:22.680
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Napakahalaga po na ituloy ang laban na ito para sa justisya.

asr-000380
00:42:23.280 --> 00:42:25.540
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, muli, maraming salamat, Madam Speaker.

asr-000381
00:42:25.700 --> 00:42:26.940
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Madaming salamat po sa sponsor.

asr-000382
00:42:27.020 --> 00:42:29.140
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At pagbati po sa CHR.

asr-000383
00:42:29.220 --> 00:42:29.580
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Thank you.

asr-000384
00:42:31.120 --> 00:42:31.980
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: Majority Leader.

