asr-000750
01:21:22.780 --> 01:21:28.320
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: ng ating colleague, our Senior Deputy Minority Leader, Representative Leila de Lima.

asr-000751
01:21:29.180 --> 01:21:38.180
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Madam Speaker, Madam Sponsor, the Philippines ranking in the World Justice Project Rule of Law Index showed a slight improvement overall.

asr-000752
01:21:38.900 --> 01:21:48.980
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Moving from 99th out of 142 countries in 2024 to 97th out of 143 countries in 2025.

asr-000753
01:21:49.500 --> 01:21:51.640
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: However, the country remained.

asr-000754
01:21:52.200 --> 01:22:08.060
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: 118th in fundamental rights while its civil justice ranking deteriorated from 98th to 106th despite an improvement in criminal justice from 124th to 119th.

asr-000755
01:22:08.060 --> 01:22:23.980
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Sa kabila ng slight improvement overall, nananatiling mababa ang performance natin sa fundamental rights. Ano po ang nakikitang pangunahing gaps ng CHR at ano ang mga hakbang nitong ginagawa para matugunan ang mga ito?

asr-000756
01:22:28.620 --> 01:22:37.980
Rep. Ma. Cristina Talavera Lopez: Madam Speaker, on national protection mechanism, this aim for a comprehensive and institutionalized national mechanism that integrates

asr-000757
01:22:38.060 --> 01:22:52.380
Rep. Ma. Cristina Talavera Lopez: prevention, protection, and response. It also enhances coordination across stakeholders, utilizes data-driven system for decision-making, and also ensures inclusivity through GAD principle.

asr-000758
01:22:53.240 --> 01:23:07.080
Rep. Ma. Cristina Talavera Lopez: Ang PKP framework po aims to address the gaps. For example, yung delayed response to incidents, weak interagency coordination, at yung ating limited integration of data system.

asr-000759
01:23:07.080 --> 01:23:08.040
Rep. Ma. Cristina Talavera Lopez: Meron din po.

asr-000760
01:23:08.060 --> 01:23:14.060
Rep. Ma. Cristina Talavera Lopez: Mayroon din po tayong uneven access to service across regions by establishing a unified human rights.

asr-000761
01:23:16.080 --> 01:23:29.060
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Para ba tugunan ang pagbaba ng civil justice? Anong mga interventions ang kailangan ng CHR at may sapat po bang pondo or funds sa kasulukuyang budget para maisagawa ang mga ito?

asr-000762
01:23:30.080 --> 01:23:35.300
Rep. Ma. Cristina Talavera Lopez: Actually po, lagi po naman tayong hindi sapat ang pondo, Madam Speaker.

asr-000763
01:23:35.700 --> 01:23:38.060
Rep. Ma. Cristina Talavera Lopez: Pero siyempre po, we have the continuing

asr-000764
01:23:38.060 --> 01:23:46.060
Rep. Ma. Cristina Talavera Lopez: advocacy for passage of HRD laws and also lahat po ng bill for CADB.

asr-000765
01:23:48.380 --> 01:24:08.040
Rep. Ma. Cristina Talavera Lopez: Ang budget po kasi natin for 2027 para sa protection ay 95 million ay hindi po sapat para mapalawak at gumawa ng bagong mga programa at tustusan ang gastos ng 17 regional offices na nangangailangan po ng mga sasakyan,

asr-000766
01:24:08.060 --> 01:24:13.300
Rep. Ma. Cristina Talavera Lopez: gas at kung ano-ano pa para po sa ating mga imbestigasyon.

asr-000767
01:24:14.360 --> 01:24:24.060
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: At para po sa huling katanungan, Madam Speaker, Madam Sponsor, sa criminal justice naman, umangat tayo from 124 to 119.

asr-000768
01:24:25.280 --> 01:24:27.740
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Pero mababa pa rin ang standing natin.

asr-000769
01:24:27.740 --> 01:24:37.980
