asr-000770
01:24:38.060 --> 01:24:39.480
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: At human rights protection?

asr-000771
01:24:40.880 --> 01:24:54.560
Rep. Ma. Cristina Talavera Lopez: Unang-una po, Madam Speaker, kailangan po natin madagdagan ang budget ng ating komisyon para ma-establish po at mapalakas ang national protection mechanism para po sa ating human rights defenders.

asr-000772
01:24:54.920 --> 01:25:06.560
Rep. Ma. Cristina Talavera Lopez: Katulad po ng ating bantay karapatang pantao, kalinga karapatang pantao, at tugon karapatang pantao, nagkakahalaga po itong an additional 13 million pesos.

asr-000773
01:25:08.060 --> 01:25:12.940
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Sa huli, ito'y lumalabas na nasa budget pa rin ang problema.

asr-000774
01:25:13.840 --> 01:25:30.380
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: In closing, Madam Speaker, Madam Sponsor, I would like to manifest that the budget of the Commission on Human Rights should be sufficient to allow the CHR to fully carry out its constitutional mandate, which is to protect and uphold the rights of our people.

asr-000775
01:25:30.380 --> 01:25:39.600
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: We trust that the guidance of the good sponsor, this chamber, will give due consideration to strengthening the CHR's budget.

asr-000777
