asr-001224
01:50:35.240 --> 01:51:03.750
Rep. Jonathan Keith T. Flores: And for the purpose, Madam Speaker, may we acknowledge the heads and officials of the said department, namely Secretary Henry Rhoel Aguda; Chief of Staff Maria Teresa Magno Garcia; Undersecretary Heherson Asiddao.

asr-001225
01:51:03.760 --> 01:51:33.710
