asr-004009
04:35:27.340 --> 04:35:29.860
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: hindi po katanggap-tanggap

asr-004010
04:35:29.860 --> 04:35:31.560
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: ang excuse

asr-004011
04:35:31.560 --> 04:35:32.920
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: ng Department of Labor

asr-004012
04:35:32.920 --> 04:35:33.700
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: and Employment.

asr-004013
04:35:34.360 --> 04:35:35.080
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Sabi nyo po,

