Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: merong labor groups

asr-004015
04:35:36.500 --> 04:35:37.100
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: na present

asr-004016
04:35:37.100 --> 04:35:37.780
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: nandoon

asr-004017
04:35:37.780 --> 04:35:38.940
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: ang buong National Wage

asr-004018
04:35:38.940 --> 04:35:39.700
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Coalition.

asr-004019
04:35:40.640 --> 04:35:41.220
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Tinaguan

asr-004020
04:35:41.220 --> 04:35:42.380
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: ang Department of Labor

asr-004021
04:35:42.380 --> 04:35:43.140
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: and Employment.

asr-004022
04:35:43.760 --> 04:35:44.660
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: At ang punto dito,

asr-004023
04:35:45.480 --> 04:35:46.240
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: kung nagkaroon man

asr-004024
04:35:46.240 --> 04:35:47.100
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: ng ibang meeting

asr-004025
