Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ng diesel, gasolina, LPG,

asr-005297
05:29:28.380 --> 05:29:30.380
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: kerosene. At maski ang Kongreso

asr-005298
05:29:30.380 --> 05:29:32.380
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na ito na

asr-005299
05:29:32.380 --> 05:29:34.380
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: nagpasa ng pagkakaroon

asr-005300
05:29:34.380 --> 05:29:36.380
