asr-005301
05:29:36.380 --> 05:29:38.380
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: para sa Presidente na suspendihin

asr-005302
05:29:38.380 --> 05:29:40.380
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ang excise taxes,

asr-005303
05:29:40.380 --> 05:29:42.380
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sa ngayon po wala na

asr-005304
05:29:42.380 --> 05:29:44.380
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na in effect. Dahil

asr-005305
05:29:44.380 --> 05:29:46.380
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: nag-expire na yung para

asr-005306
