asr-005799
05:58:33.900 --> 05:58:36.440
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: Huwebes na po pala ngayon, I was supposed to say Thursday,

asr-005800
05:58:36.860 --> 05:58:38.540
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: we will give it within the week, so that's

asr-005801
05:58:38.540 --> 05:58:40.460
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: Friday. To the

asr-005802
05:58:40.460 --> 05:58:42.480
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: answer, kasi nga po, it's a

asr-005803
05:58:42.480 --> 05:58:44.260
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: special law po yun eh, so

asr-005804
05:58:44.260 --> 05:58:46.600
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: ang DOLE, ang role lang po ng DOLE is limited to that.

asr-005805
05:58:47.060 --> 05:58:48.560
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: So yung pag, yung kanyang

asr-005806
05:58:48.560 --> 05:58:49.760
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: nabanggit niyo po kanina,

asr-005807
05:58:50.260 --> 05:58:52.280
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: yung mga ahensyang yun lamang

asr-005808
05:58:52.280 --> 05:58:53.760
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: may tamang jurisdiction,

asr-005809
05:58:54.220 --> 05:58:56.020
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: ito mo po dito, Madam Speaker, distinguished colleague.

asr-005810
05:58:57.000 --> 05:58:58.340
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Ninonote po kasi natin, Madam

asr-005811
05:58:58.340 --> 05:59:00.560
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Speaker, good sponsor, na

asr-005812
05:59:00.560 --> 05:59:02.560
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: the Omnibus Investments

asr-005813
05:59:02.560 --> 05:59:04.580
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Code of 1987

asr-005814
05:59:04.580 --> 05:59:06.380
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: nakalaan dito

asr-005815
05:59:06.380 --> 05:59:08.520
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: that the Board of Investments can

asr-005816
05:59:08.520 --> 05:59:12.880
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: for violations of

asr-005817
05:59:12.880 --> 05:59:14.520
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: the laws

asr-005818
05:59:14.520 --> 05:59:16.200
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: for the protection of labor

asr-005819
05:59:16.200 --> 05:59:18.340
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ay maaaring magkansela

asr-005820
05:59:18.340 --> 05:59:20.120
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ng mga incentives

asr-005821
05:59:20.120 --> 05:59:22.240
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na ini-enjoy ng mga enterprises.

asr-005822
05:59:23.140 --> 05:59:24.120
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: At the same time,

asr-005823
05:59:24.220 --> 05:59:26.200
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na mandato po ng

asr-005824
05:59:26.200 --> 05:59:28.280
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Department of Labor and Employment, according

asr-005825
05:59:28.280 --> 05:59:30.260
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: to not only its website,

asr-005826
05:59:30.440 --> 05:59:32.500
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: pero in laws

asr-005827
05:59:32.500 --> 05:59:34.000
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na it

asr-005828
05:59:34.000 --> 05:59:36.500
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: promotes gainful employment opportunities

asr-005829
05:59:36.500 --> 05:59:37.920
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: and human resource development,

asr-005830
05:59:38.640 --> 05:59:40.240
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: protect and promote workers' rights

asr-005831
05:59:40.240 --> 05:59:42.360
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: and welfare, and promote and

asr-005832
05:59:42.360 --> 05:59:44.260
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: maintain industrial peace.

asr-005833
05:59:44.860 --> 05:59:46.140
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So, wala po bang

asr-005834
05:59:46.140 --> 05:59:48.160
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: role yung DOLE sa

asr-005835
05:59:48.160 --> 05:59:50.020
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: pag-ensure

asr-005836
05:59:50.020 --> 05:59:52.580
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na that the Board of Investments

asr-005837
05:59:52.580 --> 05:59:54.200
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: gets the

asr-005838
05:59:54.220 --> 05:59:55.800
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: appropriate information

asr-005839
05:59:55.800 --> 05:59:58.160
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: to say na kung may

asr-005840
05:59:58.160 --> 05:59:59.540
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: violation of

asr-005841
05:59:59.540 --> 05:59:59.980
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: the laws.

asr-005842
06:00:00.000 --> 06:00:08.760
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: for the protection of labor, ay maaari nilang i-cancel yung mga incentives ng specific locators or ng establishments

asr-005843
06:00:08.760 --> 06:00:13.360
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: dahil ito po yung nakalagay sa Omnibus Investments Code.

asr-005844
06:00:13.740 --> 06:00:20.220
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Ano pong role ng DOLE sa pag-implementa ng Board of Investments ng ganitong klaseng kapangyarihan nila?

asr-005845
06:00:21.100 --> 06:00:23.960
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: Madam Speaker, distinguished colleague. Tama po yung binanggit po ninyo.

asr-005846
06:00:24.640 --> 06:00:28.580
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: At I would like to quote sa unang binanggit po ninyo.

asr-005847
06:00:28.580 --> 06:00:37.660
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: That ang role po ng Departamento ay ipakita sa ating mga ibang kasama na ahensya na ito po ang findings ng ating Departamento.

asr-005848
06:00:38.280 --> 06:00:42.660
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: So bari, yung sinasabi po nyo, kung anong role pertaining doon sa kung pwedeng i-cancela,

asr-005849
06:00:43.300 --> 06:00:49.600
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: ay hindi na po namin sakop ang kapangyarihan ito sapagkat kami po, based on the data that we have,

asr-005850
06:00:49.920 --> 06:00:57.580
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: and I think we have furnished our distinguished colleague na kumpleto naman po yung aming inspections pertaining to that

asr-005851
06:00:57.580 --> 06:00:58.580
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: but to the matter of...

asr-005852
06:00:58.580 --> 06:01:05.700
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: So na kami po ay magkakancela, we don't have that jurisdiction, Madam Speaker, distinguished colleague.

asr-005853
06:01:06.620 --> 06:01:15.260
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: And I'd like to add, na sisiguraduhin ko po sa inyo, na tayo po ay ginagampanan natin yung ating mga inspections sa lahat ng ating mga ecozones during that time.

asr-005854
06:01:15.980 --> 06:01:26.160
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So to clarify, Madam Speaker, good sponsor, ano po yung role ng DOLE vis-a-vis yung Board of Investments

asr-005855
06:01:26.160 --> 06:01:28.460
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: or yung Fiscal Incentives Review Board?

asr-005856
06:01:28.580 --> 06:01:34.700
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Kung may findings sila na may violation sa loss on protecting labor na nangyari?

asr-005857
06:01:36.160 --> 06:01:42.660
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: Madam Speaker, distinguished colleague, sabi ko nga po, pag-check ng DOLE, ang role ng DOLE, if they're in compliance,

asr-005858
06:01:43.200 --> 06:01:45.960
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: kung may violations, obligadong ilalagay din po natin yan.

asr-005859
06:01:46.920 --> 06:01:51.200
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: And we have the records, Madam Speaker, distinguished colleague, if needed and necessary.

asr-005860
06:01:51.200 --> 06:01:58.220
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Does the DOLE submit these findings of violations to the Board of Investments?

asr-005861
06:01:58.580 --> 06:02:02.500
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: How often do they submit it? How often do they meet, etc.?

asr-005862
06:02:02.500 --> 06:02:05.120
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Paano po nila nakakommunicate yung gano'ng klaseng violations?

asr-005863
06:02:07.700 --> 06:02:10.680
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: Madam Speaker, distinguished colleague, we can submit to a report.

asr-005864
06:02:10.900 --> 06:02:18.600
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: But gusto ko lang po dagdagan, but in terms of pag-OSH law na po, ito po ay pwedeng patawan na agad ng Departamento.

asr-005865
06:02:19.700 --> 06:02:22.500
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Sa violation ng OSH, for example.

asr-005866
06:02:23.060 --> 06:02:23.520
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Sa OSH po.

asr-005867
06:02:23.520 --> 06:02:27.520
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Gusto natin ma-insure na may...

asr-005868
06:02:28.580 --> 06:02:30.980
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ...accountability sa ibang ahensya.

asr-005869
06:02:31.520 --> 06:02:38.080
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Lalo na po, nasa mandato naman po ng ahensya na yun na may accountability kung may violation sa protection,

asr-005870
06:02:38.800 --> 06:02:45.480
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: loss of protection of labor, meron po ba itong report na isinusumite, for example,

asr-005871
06:02:45.620 --> 06:02:50.360
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: sa mga dapat pong may action on incentives, for example,

asr-005872
06:02:50.360 --> 06:02:57.820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: para hindi lang po titigil tayo sa accountability on OSH law.

asr-005873
06:02:58.580 --> 06:03:00.940
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And other forms of accountability when applicable.

asr-005874
06:03:01.900 --> 06:03:10.980
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: Madam Speaker, distinguished colleague, yes, sabi ko nga po, ginagawa ng ating Departamento yung role po natin na we furnish everybody a copy.

asr-005875
06:03:11.440 --> 06:03:21.240
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: And for the appreciation of our distinguished colleague, pwede naman po tayong mag-submit sa inyong tanggapan ng lahat ng aming mga ginawang patungkol po dito.

asr-005876
06:03:21.880 --> 06:03:27.960
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker, good sponsor, kung maisusumite po dito sa representasyon na ito,

asr-005877
06:03:28.580 --> 06:03:38.260
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: kopya ng report, kung paano po tinitiyak ng DOLE na yung modes of accountability niya,

asr-005878
06:03:38.380 --> 06:03:45.200
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: it does not stop at what it can do as the extent of powers it has.

asr-005879
06:03:45.200 --> 06:03:55.400
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Pero pagbibigay ng impormasyon and coordination with other agencies na maaaring magbigay yung DOLE ng impormasyon sa kanila,

asr-005880
06:03:56.220 --> 06:03:58.400
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: at madetalye po sana.

asr-005881
06:03:58.580 --> 06:03:59.280
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Sa isang report.

asr-005882
06:03:59.600 --> 06:04:08.240
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Kasi the DOLE is in the best opportunity, in the best position na magbigay ng impormasyon na ito.

asr-005883
06:04:08.480 --> 06:04:10.880
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Halos wala naman na pong ibang makakapagbigay nito.

asr-005884
06:04:10.880 --> 06:04:18.240
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: At kung kaya pong aktuhan ng Board of Investments ayon po sa impormasyon ng DOLE,

asr-005885
06:04:19.060 --> 06:04:27.880
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: dapat lang po, we'd like not to see a scenario where there are locators, establishments that enjoy incentives

asr-005886
06:04:28.580 --> 06:04:35.080
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: but are repeated violators of laws protecting labor.

asr-005887
06:04:35.640 --> 06:04:39.660
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker, good sponsor, maaasahan po ba natin yung report na ito?

asr-005888
06:04:39.660 --> 06:04:42.920
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague, yes. That's a definite yes.

asr-005889
06:04:43.200 --> 06:04:51.040
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: And if our Distinguished Colleague, can I make a plea?

asr-005890
06:04:51.500 --> 06:04:54.260
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: Kanina po, binanggit ko po na isasubmit po namin ng biyernes.

asr-005891
06:04:54.840 --> 06:04:58.460
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: Pagtingin ko po doon sa ating monitor ay Huwebes na po pala ngayon.

asr-005892
06:04:58.580 --> 06:05:03.100
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: If it would be allowable, pagpinayagan po tayo ng ating Distinguished Colleague,

asr-005893
06:05:03.560 --> 06:05:07.360
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: kasi biyernes na po ay technically bukas na po, kung papayagan niyo po kami,

asr-005894
06:05:07.580 --> 06:05:12.300
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: isasubmit po namin ang lahat ng dokumentong hiningi po ninyo by Monday of next week

asr-005895
06:05:12.300 --> 06:05:16.620
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: if it's papayagan po ng ating Distinguished Colleague, Madam Speaker.

asr-005896
06:05:16.980 --> 06:05:18.860
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Yes po, okay naman po yung Madam Speaker, good sponsor.

asr-005897
06:05:18.860 --> 06:05:20.140
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: Maraming salamat po, Distinguished Colleague.

asr-005898
06:05:20.600 --> 06:05:26.980
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: My last line of questioning, Madam Speaker, good sponsor, is in relation po sa tinanong din po natin sa TESDA,

asr-005899
06:05:28.580 --> 06:05:38.840
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Project UNLAD, kung saan ito ay partnership ng DICT sa pag-ensure na yung AI upskilling

asr-005900
06:05:38.840 --> 06:05:43.840
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ay hindi lang po ito nagagawa ng pro forma,

asr-005901
06:05:44.640 --> 06:05:52.740
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: pero substantively nakakapagpataas ng kalidad ng ating mga BPO workers

asr-005902
06:05:52.740 --> 06:05:58.460
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: and other such workers na nangailangan ng ganitong skillset.

asr-005903
06:05:58.580 --> 06:06:05.460
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Nakita po natin sa report that around 18,500 na manggagawa

asr-005904
06:06:05.460 --> 06:06:08.660
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ang nakakatanggap ng upskilling under Project UNLAD.

asr-005905
06:06:09.660 --> 06:06:15.240
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Pero ang tanong po natin sa bantanang layoffs sa gitna ng paggamit ng AI sa mga BPO companies,

asr-005906
06:06:16.360 --> 06:06:21.740
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: sapat ba na around that number ang nakakatanggap ng upskilling under Project UNLAD

asr-005907
06:06:21.740 --> 06:06:24.360
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: upang masiguro ang kanilang tuloy-tuloy na trabaho?

asr-005908
06:06:24.640 --> 06:06:25.720
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker, good sponsor.

asr-005909
06:06:26.840 --> 06:06:28.520
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague,

asr-005910
06:06:28.580 --> 06:06:35.060
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: before I directly answer your question, let me read first the status of the AI upskilling.

asr-005911
06:06:35.800 --> 06:06:41.600
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: One, TESDA is calling up its AI skills programs in line with the National AI Upskilling Roadmap

asr-005912
06:06:41.600 --> 06:06:45.440
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: through different delivery modalities such as institution-based delivery,

asr-005913
06:06:46.180 --> 06:06:48.360
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: enterprise-based training and online courses.

asr-005914
06:06:49.280 --> 06:06:56.840
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: TESDA has already allocated 53,442 scholarship slots for AI and digital-related skills

asr-005915
06:06:56.840 --> 06:06:58.440
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: as of August 20, 2026.

asr-005916
06:06:58.580 --> 06:07:06.460
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: The context would be that TESDA recognizes the need to adopt our workforce with AI.

asr-005917
06:07:06.780 --> 06:07:07.980
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: Kailangan, kailangan na po yan.

asr-005918
06:07:08.580 --> 06:07:12.980
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: Estimates vary but different analysis place the number of jobs that will be affected by AI

asr-005919
06:07:12.980 --> 06:07:16.080
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: around 25 to 35 percent of jobs.

asr-005920
06:07:16.660 --> 06:07:18.140
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: That's roughly around 12 million.

asr-005921
06:07:18.860 --> 06:07:23.500
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: And the National AI Upskilling Roadmap segmentizes the labor force into three clusters

asr-005922
06:07:23.500 --> 06:07:26.260
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: that represent three A's in AI.

asr-005923
06:07:26.260 --> 06:07:28.540
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: One is AI awareness, AI adoption,

asr-005924
06:07:28.580 --> 06:07:29.820
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: and AI advancement.

asr-005925
06:07:30.460 --> 06:07:36.080
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: This entails different courses from foundational competencies and AI literacy

asr-005926
06:07:36.080 --> 06:07:40.900
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: to more specialized and advanced courses that will equip Filipinos with skills

asr-005927
06:07:40.900 --> 06:07:44.980
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: not only to consume but also to build AI systems.

asr-005928
06:07:45.100 --> 06:07:46.580
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague.

asr-005929
06:07:47.700 --> 06:07:49.340
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So Madam Speaker, good sponsor,

asr-005930
06:07:50.140 --> 06:07:55.300
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ano po yung sagot natin dun sa tanong nasapat po ba ang may 18,

asr-005931
06:07:55.460 --> 06:07:57.820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: or rather ang namention may some 50,000?

asr-005932
06:07:57.820 --> 06:07:58.420
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: 53,000.

asr-005933
06:07:58.580 --> 06:07:59.740
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: 53,442.

asr-005934
06:08:00.120 --> 06:08:03.600
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: Madam, doon sa pagbanggit ko nga po kanina,

asr-005935
06:08:03.780 --> 06:08:05.980
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: siguro I forgot to mention TESDA.

asr-005936
06:08:06.500 --> 06:08:09.140
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: That's the reason na ang unchallenged po sa atin ngayon,

asr-005937
06:08:09.360 --> 06:08:11.440
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: ang ating hinihingi ng ating ekonomiya.

asr-005938
06:08:12.180 --> 06:08:13.740
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: Isang role ng DOLE and TESDA,

asr-005939
06:08:13.920 --> 06:08:15.380
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: TESDA to be specific,

asr-005940
06:08:16.100 --> 06:08:19.400
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: na i-reskill, i-upskill,

asr-005941
06:08:19.980 --> 06:08:24.000
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: and kung sa tanong mo kung sapat na yung binanggit mong 18,000,

asr-005942
06:08:24.000 --> 06:08:27.220
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: or in fact, based sa 53,442,

asr-005943
06:08:27.220 --> 06:08:30.160
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: sa official stance po ng TESDA,

asr-005944
06:08:30.780 --> 06:08:33.340
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: ito po ay nabawasan nga yung pondo for 2027,

asr-005945
06:08:33.980 --> 06:08:37.020
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: compared to the GAA of 2026.

asr-005946
06:08:37.600 --> 06:08:43.520
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: So ang tamang sagot po dyan ay kulang pa po yung ating mga programa,

asr-005947
06:08:43.900 --> 06:08:46.500
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: and sa ating opening statement po kanina,

asr-005948
06:08:46.600 --> 06:08:49.540
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: ay binanggit po natin na kung maaari itong madagdagan,

asr-005949
06:08:49.700 --> 06:08:52.280
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: ay welcome na welcome po yan sa aming departamento.

asr-005950
06:08:53.760 --> 06:08:57.040
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: As a last question, Madam Speaker, good sponsor,

asr-005951
06:08:57.220 --> 06:08:59.220
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: or for now,

asr-005952
06:08:59.220 --> 06:09:02.780
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: hinihingi po ng kopya sana ang representasyon na ito ng Roadmap,

asr-005953
06:09:02.780 --> 06:09:07.040
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na I assume na medyo fresh or hot off the press pa siya,

asr-005954
06:09:07.040 --> 06:09:09.040
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: pero other than that,

asr-005955
06:09:09.040 --> 06:09:13.500
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ano po ba yung mga indicators natin na successful yung upskilling?

asr-005956
06:09:13.500 --> 06:09:16.160
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Yung ilan pong siguro inaasahan natin,

asr-005957
06:09:16.160 --> 06:09:18.160
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: yung promotion sa trabaho,

asr-005958
06:09:18.160 --> 06:09:20.160
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: increased salary,

asr-005959
06:09:20.160 --> 06:09:24.600
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: siguro mas mabilis na turnout, etc.

asr-005960
06:09:24.600 --> 06:09:26.600
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Ano po ba ang mga indicators na ito?

asr-005961
06:09:27.220 --> 06:09:34.220
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: Magandang tanong, to justify na kami po ay ang TESDA po ay humihingi po ng karagdagang budget for that.

asr-005962
06:09:34.220 --> 06:09:36.220
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: One, Madam Speaker, distinguished colleague,

asr-005963
06:09:36.220 --> 06:09:39.220
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: I'd like to state for the record,

asr-005964
06:09:39.220 --> 06:09:43.220
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: na lahat po nang dumaan sa tech-voc path,

asr-005965
06:09:43.220 --> 06:09:47.220
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: ay based on the results na ginagawa po natin,

asr-005966
06:09:47.220 --> 06:09:50.220
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: ay meron pong 83.4% employability.

asr-005967
06:09:50.220 --> 06:09:55.220
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: Ibig sabihin, pag ikaw po ay dumaan sa skills training sa TESDA,

asr-005968
06:09:55.220 --> 06:09:57.220
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: ay mataas, o napakataas,

asr-005969
06:09:57.220 --> 06:09:59.220
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: ng chance for employability.

asr-005970
06:09:59.220 --> 06:10:03.220
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: And also, it goes to show sa ating certification program,

asr-005971
06:10:03.220 --> 06:10:10.220
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: na if it is applicable to or acceptable to the distinguished colleague,

asr-005972
06:10:10.220 --> 06:10:12.220
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: ay marami po na tayo nagawa dyan,

asr-005973
06:10:12.220 --> 06:10:14.220
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: and we can definitely furnish you

asr-005974
06:10:14.220 --> 06:10:17.220
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: of all that necessary reports pertaining to certification,

asr-005975
06:10:17.220 --> 06:10:20.220
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: and what I've said, the 83.4% employability

asr-005976
06:10:20.220 --> 06:10:24.220
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: ng mga dumadaan sa tech-voc path po natin sa ating bansang Pilipinas.

asr-005977
06:10:24.220 --> 06:10:26.220
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Hintayin po natin yung ulat na yun.

asr-005978
06:10:26.220 --> 06:10:33.220
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Siguro sana po sa lunes ay maisabay siya doon sa submissions as well ng DOLE.

asr-005979
06:10:33.220 --> 06:10:37.220
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Ang huli na lang po nating manifestation ay up until now,

asr-005980
06:10:37.220 --> 06:10:43.220
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: mataas ang anxiety ng mga tao tungkol sa layoffs na dulot ng AI.

asr-005981
06:10:43.220 --> 06:10:47.220
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: At kung we ride the trend of upskilling,

asr-005982
06:10:47.220 --> 06:10:55.220
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ang naishare po so far ay hindi rin po nakikita sa indicators na may job security dito.

asr-005983
06:10:55.220 --> 06:10:58.220
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So, nonetheless, Madam Speaker, good sponsor,

asr-005984
06:10:58.220 --> 06:11:05.220
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: we'd like to register na ito yung anxiety at ito yung hirap na pinakaharap ng ating mga BPO workers.

asr-005985
06:11:05.220 --> 06:11:11.220
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: At beyond upskilling, no, gusto natin tuloy-tuloy na may sagot doon sa tanong na paano ba i-ensure

asr-005986
06:11:11.220 --> 06:11:16.220
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na may disenteng trabaho, na may nakabubuhay na sahod ang mga manggagawang Pilipino.

asr-005987
06:11:16.220 --> 06:11:20.220
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Yun lang po, Madam Speaker, maraming salamat po. Thank you, good sponsor.

asr-005988
06:11:20.220 --> 06:11:23.220
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: Maraming salamat, Madam Speaker. Thank you, distinguished colleague.

asr-005989
06:11:23.220 --> 06:11:30.220
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: And yes, we will submit on Monday together with the DOLE and TESDA reports, Distinguished Colleague. Maraming salamat po.

asr-005990
06:11:30.220 --> 06:11:32.220
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: Majority Leader?

asr-005991
06:11:32.220 --> 06:11:37.220
Floor Leader: Madam Speaker, I'd like to acknowledge our last interpellator of the day,

asr-005992
06:11:37.220 --> 06:11:41.220
Floor Leader: the Honorable Perci Cendaña from the Akbayan Party-list.

asr-005993
06:11:41.220 --> 06:11:46.220
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: Representative Perci Cendaña of Akbayan Party-list is hereby recognized for his interpellation.

asr-005994
06:11:46.220 --> 06:11:52.220
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Maraming salamat, Madam Speaker. Magandang umaga po. Ginoong sponsor at sa buong DOLE family.

asr-005995
06:11:52.220 --> 06:11:57.220
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: At siyempre kasama dyan, special mention, ang paborito nating TESDA.

asr-005996
06:11:57.220 --> 06:12:04.220
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: At ngayon po, pinag-uusapan natin ang budget ng Department of Labor and Employment.

asr-005997
06:12:04.220 --> 06:12:08.220
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: At pangunahin dito yung usapin ng workers' rights and welfare.

asr-005998
06:12:08.220 --> 06:12:21.220
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: But the irony is not lost on me. Marami po mga manggagawa tayo dito sa loob ng Kongreso, sa ating mga opisina, at mismo po sa DOLE, ang Puyat na ngayong araw na ito.

asr-005999
06:12:21.220 --> 06:12:27.220
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: And while naniniwala tayo na dapat walang tulugan para sa transparency and accountability,

asr-006000
06:12:27.220 --> 06:12:32.220
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: sa dulo po dapat huwag din nating pabayaan ang kapakanan ng ating mga manggagawa.

asr-006001
06:12:32.220 --> 06:12:37.220
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Let me begin with a humble appeal to the leadership of the House of Representatives.

asr-006002
06:12:37.220 --> 06:12:43.220
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Natiyakin po natin yung kapakanan, kalusugan ng ating mga manggagawa, ang kanilang well-being.

asr-006003
06:12:43.220 --> 06:12:50.220
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Hindi po talaga makatarungan ang ganitong uri ng diskurso sa ganitong alangan ng oras na ng madaling araw.

asr-006004
06:12:51.220 --> 06:12:56.220
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: And the irony of it all, we're talking about workers' rights and welfare now.

asr-006005
06:12:56.220 --> 06:13:11.220
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Balik lang po ako, Madam Speaker, ginaong sponsor doon sa kaninang exchange between the good sponsor and Representative Elly tungkol po sa nangyaring September 10 NWPC meeting.

asr-006006
06:13:11.220 --> 06:13:20.220
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Allegedly, may nangyaring NWPC meeting noong September 10. At nabanggit din po kanina na isang dahilan kaya po lumipat ng kwarto ay dahil daw po mayroong disruption.

asr-006007
06:13:21.220 --> 06:13:29.220
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Can the good sponsor elaborate further on this claim about disruptions or disruptors?

asr-006008
06:13:29.220 --> 06:13:42.220
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: Madam Speaker, distinguished colleague, well, the process sa wage setting, Madam Speaker, distinguished colleague, there's a reason na bakit po may proseso.

asr-006009
06:13:42.220 --> 06:13:50.220
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: One, nabanggit po natin leading to the September 10, was that there was already a public hearing.

asr-006010
06:13:51.220 --> 06:13:55.220
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: Or consultation, but technically the right word is public hearing. September 2 po yan.

asr-006011
06:13:55.220 --> 06:14:00.220
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: Na marami po yung, we have pictures and videos na lahat naman po doon ay imbitado.

asr-006012
06:14:00.220 --> 06:14:14.220
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: Pertaining doon po sa sinasabing September 10, tandaan po ninyo, yung ito na po ay nagpapatukoy doon sa Wage Order No. 28 na dapat ay affirmation.

asr-006013
06:14:14.220 --> 06:14:20.220
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: And for the record, sabi ko nga po kanina, Madam Speaker, distinguished colleague, the reason of being wage na ito po ay ating nabanggit.

asr-006014
06:14:21.220 --> 06:14:30.220
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: Sapagkat, yung mga miyembro dapat ng ating na kung saan na, nasa affirmation doon sa ating wage order, ay dapat nandun na po.

asr-006015
06:14:30.220 --> 06:14:37.220
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: Nandun din yun sa binanggit ko na yung labor sector. Unfortunately, yung isa pong miyembro ay wala po.

asr-006016
06:14:37.220 --> 06:14:43.220
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: And we have the minutes to prove so, na yun lamang po dapat talaga yung mga naroon.

asr-006017
06:14:43.220 --> 06:14:47.220
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: So in short, Madam Speaker, distinguished colleague,

asr-006018
06:14:47.220 --> 06:14:55.220
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: yung board po mismo yun nandun. And siguro, you just don't take my word for it.

asr-006019
06:14:55.220 --> 06:14:59.220
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: Kanina nga po, I've asked permission from the good secretariat, tandaan po natin yung

asr-006020
06:15:00.000 --> 06:15:02.560
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: yung dapat yung pag nagdi-desisyon na

asr-006021
06:15:02.560 --> 06:15:05.520
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: o pag mag-a-affirm na ang NWPC,

asr-006022
06:15:06.160 --> 06:15:10.940
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: it is not mandated na ibigay yung minutes of the said meeting.

asr-006023
06:15:11.380 --> 06:15:13.940
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: Pero kami po, sabi ko nga po, on the record,

asr-006024
06:15:14.580 --> 06:15:15.920
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: kasi ganun po kami kakumpiyansa,

asr-006025
06:15:16.060 --> 06:15:18.460
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: is because we are willing to do so.

asr-006026
06:15:18.700 --> 06:15:21.380
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: Yan po ay may para at least to appease everybody.

asr-006027
06:15:21.500 --> 06:15:23.440
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: At the same time, para ipakita

asr-006028
06:15:23.440 --> 06:15:26.080
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: na kami ang Department of Labor and Employment

asr-006029
06:15:26.080 --> 06:15:28.240
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: pertaining to that September 10 meeting

asr-006030
06:15:28.240 --> 06:15:30.360
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: sa affirmation ng Wage Order 28

asr-006031
06:15:30.360 --> 06:15:32.700
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: ay walang tinatago at the same time

asr-006032
06:15:32.700 --> 06:15:34.280
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: para sinigurado rin po natin

asr-006033
06:15:34.280 --> 06:15:35.880
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: na yung Wage Order No. 28

asr-006034
06:15:35.880 --> 06:15:37.780
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: ay ma-affirm natin,

asr-006035
06:15:38.260 --> 06:15:40.980
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: ma-publish September 11

asr-006036
06:15:40.980 --> 06:15:43.020
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: and hopefully ma-implement

asr-006037
06:15:43.020 --> 06:15:46.000
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: o maging ganap na wage order

asr-006038
06:15:46.000 --> 06:15:49.340
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: to be implemented on September 26 of this year.

asr-006039
06:15:49.340 --> 06:15:50.800
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague.

asr-006040
06:15:51.580 --> 06:15:53.900
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague,

asr-006041
06:15:54.840 --> 06:15:57.480
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: I beg your indulgence, kailangan ko pong ulitin yung tanong.

asr-006042
06:15:57.480 --> 06:15:59.480
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ano po o sino yung disruptors

asr-006043
06:16:00.000 --> 06:16:02.300
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: o ano po yung disruption na nabanggit kanina?

asr-006044
06:16:03.000 --> 06:16:05.420
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: The reason as to why the meeting was transferred

asr-006045
06:16:05.420 --> 06:16:07.800
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: from the original venue to another venue?

asr-006046
06:16:11.700 --> 06:16:12.340
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: Well,

asr-006047
06:16:15.120 --> 06:16:17.780
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: let it, ilalagay ko po sa konteksto.

asr-006048
06:16:18.800 --> 06:16:21.420
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: Binanggit ko po, Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague,

asr-006049
06:16:21.500 --> 06:16:26.180
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: na yung ating affirmation ay yung wage setting na nga po.

asr-006050
06:16:26.700 --> 06:16:27.460
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: Nandun na po.

asr-006051
06:16:27.480 --> 06:16:31.360
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: Nandun na po dapat yung ating mga dapat na nandoon.

asr-006052
06:16:32.320 --> 06:16:34.220
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: Kaya nga lang po, may mga pumasok na

asr-006053
06:16:34.220 --> 06:16:36.880
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: are not supposed to be there

asr-006054
06:16:36.880 --> 06:16:40.320
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: kasi yun na nga po yung affirmation ng Wage No. 28.

asr-006055
06:16:40.440 --> 06:16:41.640
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: Tapos na po yung public hearing eh.

asr-006056
06:16:42.020 --> 06:16:44.160
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: There's a difference, Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague.

asr-006057
06:16:44.720 --> 06:16:47.440
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: Now, I have it on

asr-006058
06:16:47.440 --> 06:16:53.400
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: there's labor leaders na mga pumasok

asr-006059
06:16:53.400 --> 06:16:55.460
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: na hindi naman po dapat because

asr-006060
06:16:55.460 --> 06:16:56.440
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: sabi ko nga,

asr-006061
06:16:56.440 --> 06:16:57.040
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: ito,

asr-006062
06:16:57.480 --> 06:16:59.360
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: it was supposed to be the decision or affirmation

asr-006063
06:16:59.360 --> 06:17:01.720
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: of the NWPC already.

asr-006064
06:17:02.080 --> 06:17:03.380
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague.

asr-006065
06:17:04.660 --> 06:17:06.560
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: Go ahead, sorry.

asr-006066
06:17:06.680 --> 06:17:08.380
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: I'm so sorry, Mr. Distinguished Colleague.

asr-006067
06:17:09.280 --> 06:17:11.140
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Just to reiterate, Madam Speaker,

asr-006068
06:17:11.380 --> 06:17:11.980
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: good sponsor,

asr-006069
06:17:12.280 --> 06:17:13.700
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: hindi po disruptors

asr-006070
06:17:13.700 --> 06:17:14.740
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: o hindi disruption

asr-006071
06:17:14.740 --> 06:17:16.880
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: ang ating pong pag-assert

asr-006072
06:17:16.880 --> 06:17:18.200
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: na mga leader manggagawa

asr-006073
06:17:18.200 --> 06:17:19.820
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: o organisadong mga union

asr-006074
06:17:19.820 --> 06:17:21.260
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: ng karapatan po nila

asr-006075
06:17:21.260 --> 06:17:22.720
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: na malaman ang katotohanan

asr-006076
06:17:22.720 --> 06:17:23.560
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: at magpahayag po

asr-006077
06:17:23.560 --> 06:17:24.760
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: ng kanilang posisyon

asr-006078
06:17:24.760 --> 06:17:26.780
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: sa napakalagang issue ng sahod.

asr-006079
06:17:26.780 --> 06:17:28.360
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Lalo na po sa sahod

asr-006080
06:17:28.360 --> 06:17:30.280
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: na kailangan-kailangan dagdagan sa ngayon.

asr-006081
06:17:30.500 --> 06:17:32.020
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: But let me move on to another topic.

asr-006082
06:17:32.160 --> 06:17:33.640
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Just like to underscore

asr-006083
06:17:33.640 --> 06:17:35.900
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: that the labor movement

asr-006084
06:17:35.900 --> 06:17:36.880
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: or labor leaders

asr-006085
06:17:36.880 --> 06:17:38.460
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: are not disruptors.

asr-006086
06:17:39.480 --> 06:17:41.340
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Pag-usapan po natin yung enforcement

asr-006087
06:17:41.340 --> 06:17:43.460
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: ng Department Order 156.

asr-006088
06:17:44.140 --> 06:17:45.820
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ito po ay concern na gusto i-raise

asr-006089
06:17:45.820 --> 06:17:46.800
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: ng mga kasama natin

asr-006090
06:17:46.800 --> 06:17:48.940
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: mula sa commercial fishing industry.

asr-006091
06:17:49.540 --> 06:17:50.360
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Sabi po ng DOLE,

asr-006092
06:17:50.840 --> 06:17:52.460
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: 6,048 workers

asr-006093
06:17:52.460 --> 06:17:53.900
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: ang covered ng enforcement

asr-006094
06:17:53.900 --> 06:17:55.280
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: ng DO 156

asr-006095
06:17:55.280 --> 06:17:56.760
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: noong June 2026.

asr-006096
06:17:56.780 --> 06:17:59.120
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Gaano na po karaming

asr-006097
06:17:59.120 --> 06:17:59.780
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: individual fishers

asr-006098
06:18:00.320 --> 06:18:01.640
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: ang na-verify natin

asr-006099
06:18:01.640 --> 06:18:03.760
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: na nakakakuha na sa ngayon

asr-006100
06:18:03.760 --> 06:18:05.520
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: ng mandated minimum wage?

asr-006101
06:18:16.500 --> 06:18:17.780
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: Madam Speaker,

asr-006102
06:18:18.580 --> 06:18:19.360
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: Distinguished Colleague,

asr-006103
06:18:20.300 --> 06:18:21.780
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: based dito po sa aming datos

asr-006104
06:18:21.780 --> 06:18:24.040
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: sa June 2026,

asr-006105
06:18:24.040 --> 06:18:25.800
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: workers covered,

asr-006106
06:18:26.780 --> 06:18:28.200
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: 6,048.

asr-006107
06:18:28.800 --> 06:18:30.800
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: 6,048 po.

asr-006108
06:18:31.280 --> 06:18:32.420
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Saan po galing itong

asr-006109
06:18:32.420 --> 06:18:34.320
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: 98.91 compliance rate

asr-006110
06:18:34.320 --> 06:18:35.160
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: ng DOLE na ito?

asr-006111
06:18:54.720 --> 06:18:55.580
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: Madam Speaker,

asr-006112
06:18:55.680 --> 06:18:56.240
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: Distinguished Colleague,

asr-006113
06:18:56.400 --> 06:18:56.760
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: are you referring to the

asr-006114
06:18:56.760 --> 06:18:59.980
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: same compliance rate,

asr-006115
06:19:00.020 --> 06:19:01.920
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: 98.1% sa OSH?

asr-006116
06:19:02.420 --> 06:19:04.840
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: This was mentioned to us

